WEBVTT

00:02:59.276 --> 00:03:02.636
if branches waver at the crossroads

00:03:02.636 --> 00:03:06.876
unsure of which way to grow

00:03:07.236 --> 00:03:12.556
if leaves understand they’re replaceable

00:03:12.956 --> 00:03:17.316
and they still dance when the wind blows

00:03:17.956 --> 00:03:19.596
I wonder

00:03:19.836 --> 00:03:21.756
where the moon goes

00:03:21.916 --> 00:03:23.716
when she is in hiding

00:03:24.156 --> 00:03:26.636
I want to find her there

00:03:26.916 --> 00:03:28.396
and watch the ocean

00:03:28.396 --> 00:03:30.996
spin from a distance